ition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Abomination born of the influence of a Sui Proxy. Originally a clay pot that broke someone's skull, itself undamaged. The dinner table has always been a place for squabbles. Tables are flipped and pots are broken, but in the end, everyone might still have to sit back down and eat together.","abilities":["Can use long-ranged weapons to attack <Sapidity>"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.9,"stats":{"hp":6000,"atk":500,"def":200,"res":0,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":2}},"humility":{"slug":"humility","name":"'Humility'","icon":"/enemies-icons/'Humility'.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A drink reveals one's true nature and inspires deep conversations. Abomination born of the influence of a Sui Proxy. Often appears in drunken squabbles, but usually disappears once one is sober.","abilities":["Pulls 1 <Sapidity> within range towards itself, causing it to lose HP proportionate to distance moved when shifted"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.6,"stats":{"hp":8000,"atk":550,"def":300,"res":30,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":3}},"drifting_aroma":{"slug":"drifting_aroma","name":"Drifting Aroma","icon":"/enemies-icons/Drifting Aroma.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"Abomination born of the influence of a Sui Proxy. Boil chili and pepper in the pot, add some burdenbeast tallow, and let the aroma drift across town. Do not be too hasty when you tuck in, lest the heat burn your mouth.","abilities":["Continuously inflicts Arts damage and Burn to its surroundings","Immune to Slow"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.8,"stats":{"hp":20000,"atk":200,"d