ically summons 1 <Vapidity>"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":15000,"atk":600,"def":400,"res":50,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":4}},"vapidity":{"slug":"vapidity","name":"Vapidity","icon":"/enemies-icons/Vapidity.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"Abomination born of the meals people discard. Put down the cup and lay aside the chopsticks. All is meaningless, and the meal on the plate vapid.","abilities":["Unblockable; Moves towards <Derelict Stoves> and can be absorbed by them, increasing their SP","Must be damaged 15 times to defeat; Spawns 1 <Sapidity> when defeated","Does not count towards the defeated enemies counter; Automatically moves towards <Derelict Stoves>"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":15,"atk":100,"def":0,"res":0,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":1.7}},"sapid_auspice":{"slug":"sapid_auspice","name":"'Sapid Auspice'","icon":"/enemies-icons/'Sapid Auspice'.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Abomination born of a convergence of Sapidity. Likes to hover over places where many gather, an auspicious symbol that drives out illness and keeps disaster away.","abilities":["Deals True damage to all enemy units in its path","Cannot be attacked, does not count towards the defeated enemies counter, will not deplete Life Points on leaving the field"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":3,"stats":{"hp":100,"atk":8000,"def":0,"res":0,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":1.6}},"vapid_blight":{"slug":"vapid_blight","name":"'Vapid Blight'","icon":"/enemies-icons/'Vapid Blight'.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPo